<h2 id="_3-可撤销并查集" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-可撤销并查集"><span>3.可撤销并查集</span></a></h2>
<p>支持在执行合并操作后，随时撤销最近的若干次操作，恢复到之前的状态。通常在回溯型搜索、离线处理、决策树等问题中用到。
注意，<code v-pre>不能</code>使用路径压缩!!!</p>
<p>常见实现方式：<br>
•	栈记录合并操作前的信息（如父节点、集合大小等）<br>
•	合并时入栈，回溯时出栈还原<br></p>
<p>特点：<br>
•	查询、合并复杂度 <span v-pre class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(\alpha(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0037em;">α</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span><span class="mclose">))</span></span></span></span> <br>
•	撤销操作复杂度 <span v-pre class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span> <br></p>
